## Budgets

A budget is what the design was supposed to cost. Unlike a band it does not move with the measurement, so a number can sit inside its band for ever without ever having met its budget — which is why a missed budget is reported here rather than failing the run. Each of these opens an escalation, and the counters in the next section are the evidence it is opened with.

